{"summary":"石肾是一种矿物类中药，味咸、性平无毒，主要功效为治疗泄痢（腹泻或痢疾），药材呈白色珠状。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"《别录》曰︰味咸，无毒。主泄痢，色白如珠。","translation":"《别录》记载：味咸，无毒。主治泄痢，颜色洁白如珠。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94#石腎","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:57.612Z"}